      "observations": [
        "Fallible DER/signature/Merkle bounds cover both serde decoding and direct DTO use; fixed element types and Vec/newtype wire representation remain unchanged.",
        "Unblind validates expected epoch and configured request-selected root over exact response DER before finalization; malformed configured roots are errors, not an implicit None fallback.",
        "Pending binds the response to the original mathematical n/e key; equivalent PKCS1/SPKI encodings may interoperate without admitting a different issuer.",
        "ClientToken randomness precedes untrusted subkey retrieval in auth; explicit inherited no-root mode remains available when broker_keys is absent."
      ],
