      "observations": [
        "Read Bn/Ctx/Mont/Rsa allocation, ownership, borrowed n/e lifetime, error paths and Drop implementations; no concrete new FFI ownership defect found.",
        "Rc keeps native PublicKey/Pending non-Send/non-Sync; OwnedPending moves owned byte state across await, has no Clone/Debug/serialization, and consumes state on finalization.",
        "Native AWS-LC performs arithmetic/hash/PSS. Pinned bn.h explicitly permits secret base for BN_mod_exp_mont; inversion uses BN_mod_inverse_blinded.",
        "Width/range/DER consumption checks precede cryptographic output; signatures are verified before publication. SecretBytes cleans live buffers; Bn uses BN_clear_free."
      ],
