      "boundary": "Legacy byte-width acceptance permits 2041..4096-bit modulus widths and exponents 3/65537. This is not a new strict 2048-bit minimum or complete issuer-modulus validation. Known legacy 2049-bit blind-encoding bug is intentionally not reproduced."
